translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_fd382150:

    # "There is a mountainous presence in the middle of the chamber that you can't ignore."
    "房间中央有个山岳般庞大的存在，让你无法忽视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_bfeac4c7:

    # "Sensing your presence, the creature whips its head at you."
    "察觉到你的存在，那只生物猛地扭头望向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_0e31d1db:

    # "It charges and slams into an invisible wall. After calming down from fear, you examine the area around the minotaur closer."
    "它冲过来，狠狠撞上一堵无形的墙。你从惊恐中平复下来后，仔细查看弥诺陶洛斯周围的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_ac96bb8e:

    # "There seems to be a runic zone that keeps the creature in."
    "似乎有一个符文区域将这只生物困在其中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_23e2bd0a:

    # "Unable to grab you, the minotaur roars. The chamber trembles but you hear no sound. The imprisonment runes appear to keep the sound inside the zone as well."
    "无法抓到你，弥诺陶洛斯发出咆哮。洞室随之震颤，你却听不到任何声音。禁锢符文似乎也将声音困在了区域之内。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_8be81dba:

    # "The minotaur grunts and seems to withers slightly. You believe it grumbled something but due to the runic prison, you can't hear anything."
    "弥诺陶洛斯低声哼叫，身形似乎略微萎缩。你觉得它嘟囔了什么，但符文囚笼让你什么也听不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_20981a5b:

    # "In any case, you remember your mission. It is to draw the Minotaur's essence."
    "无论如何，你想起了自己的任务：抽取弥诺陶洛斯的精华。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_149981ed:

    # "The first step will be to take down the runic prison to approach the minotaur."
    "第一步是解除符文囚笼，以便接近弥诺陶洛斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Enter_fff86c10:

    # "That will mean exposing yourself to its aggression. You do not like the prospect of that but for the mission, you steel yourself."
    "这意味着你要暴露在它的攻击之下。你并不喜欢这个前景，但为了任务，你还是强作镇定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_8f341e14:

    # "You look at the sandstone... it seems to be made of sand... and stone, no... you've heard it's actually silicates."
    "你看着砂岩...它似乎是由沙子...和石头组成的，不对...你听说它其实是硅酸盐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_daedc7b0:

    # "A small sand pyramid, there's nothing out of the ordinary except that it is horizontally symmetric."
    "一座小小的沙金字塔，除了横向对称之外，没有任何异常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_5271b538:

    # "Some pebbles on the ground, and grasses. shouldn't be too common outside of the cave."
    "地上散落着一些鹅卵石和草。在洞穴外，这些东西本不该这么常见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_44ccf1ff:

    # "The surface of this rock is pretty flat, maybe you can balance the statue on it..."
    "这块岩石的表面相当平整，也许你可以把雕像稳稳放在上面..."

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f6a6d3dc:

    # "The rock looks flat, and there is a minotaur symbol at the center."
    "岩石看起来很平整，中央还有一个弥诺陶洛斯的标志。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_54c204c9:

    # "You look at the Minotaur... he seems to be imprisoned in the magical bind."
    "你看着弥诺陶洛斯...它似乎被囚禁在魔法束缚中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_43f5fdd6:

    # "He seems to sense your scent in front of you. Suddenly, the binds snapped and detached from the wall."
    "它似乎嗅到了你就在面前。突然，束缚崩断并从墙上脱落下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_15b3a682:

    # "The magically barrier reappear before your eyes, you cannot escape now..."
    "魔法屏障在你眼前重新出现，你现在无法逃脱了..."

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_66fdc36f:

    # "The minotaur stares at you... angrily. He holds the binds in front of you."
    "弥诺陶洛斯...愤怒地盯着你。它将那些束缚举在你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_f82219a7:

    # mn "M-master...?"
    mn "主、主人...？"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_0b98a90b:

    # "You don't know what he is talking about... you stands here, readying your weapon."
    "你不知道它在说什么...你站在原地，握紧武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_55948bf0:

    # "This only made the minotaur more angry..."
    "这反而让弥诺陶洛斯更加愤怒..."

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_9b1c37d1:

    # "As the five gems are activated, the magical barrier soon ceases its light in front of you."
    "五颗宝石全部激活后，面前的魔法屏障很快熄灭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_48cef365:

    # "A strong barrier barricading you from the minotaur inside..."
    "一道坚固的屏障将你与里面的弥诺陶洛斯隔开..."

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_7e06c097:

    # "It seems to be controlled by the gems scattered at different section of the cave, maybe you need to activate them first."
    "它似乎由散落在洞穴各处的宝石控制，也许你得先激活它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_15d1e84b:

    # "You look at the tiny statue of a minotaur, it seems to be flexing its muscles."
    "你望向弥诺陶洛斯的小雕像，它似乎正在绷紧肌肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a5d17ee1:

    # "You try to pull it out of the crater on the ground, but it seems to be stuck."
    "你试图把它从地上的凹坑里拉出来，却发现它似乎卡住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_58ede9c2:

    # "Maybe it's not to be moved..."
    "也许它根本不该被移动..."

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_e829715d:

    # "You look at the tiny statue of a minotaur, it seems to be flexing its muscles towards its right."
    "你望向弥诺陶洛斯的小雕像，它似乎正朝右侧绷紧肌肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_3c33322e:

    # "As soon as you touch the gem. It instantly convulses."
    "你刚一触碰宝石，它便立刻剧烈震颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_961543e3:

    # "The gem seems to react to your placement of statue."
    "宝石似乎对你放置雕像的举动产生了反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_0623b869:

    # "In a few seconds, the gem glows in bright red."
    "几秒后，宝石绽放出耀眼的红光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_fa906442:

    # "You can tell that the barrier at the center of the cave has been weakened."
    "你能看出洞穴中央的屏障已经减弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_a56475d2:

    # "There is a red gem on the pillar, it seems to be emanating dim light."
    "柱子上有一颗红色宝石，似乎正散发着微弱的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_ace51061:

    # "You feel like you need to do something here to make it glow."
    "你感觉自己需要在这里做些什么，才能让它发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_10fdf7b1:

    # "It comes to you that... maybe there's something to do with the statue."
    "你突然想到...也许这和那座雕像有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_254481de:

    # "The balance... must be restored. You begin to think how you can fill in the craters."
    "平衡...必须恢复。你开始思考该如何填满那些凹坑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Minotaur_Maze_Loop_599b6e8e:

    # "The gem is glowing in bright red. You feel that this zone has been completed."
    "宝石正绽放着耀眼的红光。你觉得这个区域已经完成了。"

